{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","name_native":"سنن ابن ماجه","section":{"20":"The Chapters on Legal Punishments"},"section_detail":{"20":{"hadithnumber_first":2533,"hadithnumber_last":2614,"arabicnumber_first":2533,"arabicnumber_last":2614,"name_native":"كتاب الحدود"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2557,"arabicnumber":2557,"text":"حَدَّثَنَا إِسْمَاعِيلُ بْنُ مُوسَى، حَدَّثَنَا شَرِيكٌ، عَنْ سِمَاكِ بْنِ حَرْبٍ، عَنْ جَابِرِ بْنِ سَمُرَةَ، أَنَّ النَّبِيَّ صلى الله عليه وسلم رَجَمَ يَهُودِيًّا وَيَهُودِيَّةً ‏.‏","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":20,"hadith":25}}]}